      "chunk_id": "7a1acf4fb60dbf35a7f1b8f6ccaf0a9b2f32fbc6",
      "text": "水质指标按性质可分为物理性、化学性和生物性三大类。",
      "source": "wikidb:wiki/水质指标分类.md",
      "knowledge_type": "process_doc",
